B.a07=new A.f3(["Rider ownership","How do I stop renting and start owning?","Pay a one-time programme deposit \u2014 from \u20a6400,000 for a Bajaj Boxer or \u20a62,300,000 for an approved Maruwa tricycle \u2014 take part for the three- or six-month programme, and own the vehicle. There is no further vehicle payment under the ownership offer. Applications are reviewed and verified by our own staff before anything is approved.",B.hl])
B.a0b=new A.f3(["Training & capacity","How do I stay safe and earn more?","Rider training comes with the programme at no extra charge: road safety, basic maintenance and how to protect the asset you now own. A rider who can fix a minor fault himself keeps working through the week.",B.rK])
B.a0c=new A.f3(["Logistics & haulage","Who can move goods dependably?","Our rider network handles last-mile delivery and haulage across our operating states. Partners get a vetted, trained, vehicle-owning fleet rather than a queue of renters with no stake in the job.",B.rH])
B.a0h=new A.f3(["Sustainable solutions","What else can I add to the business?","Sun King solar home systems from \u20a650,000 \u2014 panel, LED lighting, phone charging and TV support \u2014 so the income a vehicle earns can go further at home, and so a shop can stay open after dark.",B.rV])
